    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2c4004d61f01fa64019290",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高多芬阿拉伯宛如一阵风般向前奔驰。\n这种跑法确实比以往的跑法快。\n不过，在祂准备过弯时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "539c65b27e34466ba7aec78768e87f437a6c9acb66e93cccceb15456e3325ec7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9041/storytimeline_809041002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fffebe42f7139b0e5fb8f012",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样会无法保持平衡，导致重心产生偏移，\n降低跑步时的速度。\n这样实在很难算是有效率的跑法……",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a5f9aaa446e6121d4f20cbc5dd88cccbb473bca9da24ceef6135273b6f1980",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
